{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Liven Collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quaso Studio: The Liven Collection</strong> brings together two first-person psychological horror experiences, crafted in a retro PS1 style and driven by an oppressive, stylized atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into two different yet connected stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The To-Do List</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/banniere_de_la_page2.png?t=1747412576\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Complete the tasks. Survive. Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Kevin LIVEN</strong>, a 17-year-old home alone. As you go about your daily chores, the lights suddenly go out\u2026 <br>Someone breaks into the house. You're trapped. Hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think fast. Hide. Restore the power. <br>Your last hope lies in your father\u2019s locked toolbox \u2014 but the code remains a mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and collect useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive against the killer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark, oppressive atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rouge Carmin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/Paysage_1920x1080.png?t=1747412576\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A painterly nightmare rooted in regret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ten years after <i>The To-Do List</i>, <strong>Marla Myers</strong>, director of an art gallery, finds herself trapped in a crimson velvet purgatory, haunted by her past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She must explore the limbo of her own mind across two parallel worlds. Find the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rouge Carmin</i> is a narrative psychological horror game with a bold painterly aesthetic.<br>No weapons. No escape. Only your memories, your guilt\u2026 and a way out to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow an intense, twist-filled narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and collect key clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive against the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting, painterly atmosphere</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708640?t=1747412576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/6ea05ea9ae6259bb359685b688f088cf7bfe4531/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747412576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/aad203707e0245b14dd287980114be2bf30d9010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747412576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/aad203707e0245b14dd287980114be2bf30d9010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747412576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Liven Collection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quaso Studio: The Liven Collection</strong> brings together two first-person psychological horror experiences, crafted in a retro PS1 style and driven by an oppressive, stylized atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into two different yet connected stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The To-Do List</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/banniere_de_la_page2.png?t=1747412576\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Complete the tasks. Survive. Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Kevin LIVEN</strong>, a 17-year-old home alone. As you go about your daily chores, the lights suddenly go out\u2026 <br>Someone breaks into the house. You're trapped. Hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think fast. Hide. Restore the power. <br>Your last hope lies in your father\u2019s locked toolbox \u2014 but the code remains a mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and collect useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive against the killer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark, oppressive atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rouge Carmin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/Paysage_1920x1080.png?t=1747412576\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A painterly nightmare rooted in regret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ten years after <i>The To-Do List</i>, <strong>Marla Myers</strong>, director of an art gallery, finds herself trapped in a crimson velvet purgatory, haunted by her past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She must explore the limbo of her own mind across two parallel worlds. Find the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rouge Carmin</i> is a narrative psychological horror game with a bold painterly aesthetic.<br>No weapons. No escape. Only your memories, your guilt\u2026 and a way out to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow an intense, twist-filled narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and collect key clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive against the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting, painterly atmosphere</p></li></ul>","developers":["Quaso Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/d698c41ccf3759af70f9b378e86911a23ecafa77/header.jpg?t=1747412576","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Quaso Studio : The Liven Collection","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1024 VRAM); Radeon HD 7750 (1024 VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (ou \u00e9quivalent AMD Ryzen 5) ou mieux<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 1060 6 Go ou Radeon RX 580 4 Go<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"